-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Black Skull (Item)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Black_Skull_Item_3c5e64.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Black Skull</li></ul>\n<p>It looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bag\">Bag</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Belongings%20of%20a%20Deceased\">Belongings of a Deceased</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Belongings%20of%20a%20Deceased%20%28The%20Ravager%29\">Belongings of a Deceased (The Ravager)</a> and a Loot Bag (Item).\nObtained after slaying <a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Priest%20Shargon\">Death Priest Shargon</a> in <a href=\"#/quest/dark-trails-quest\">Dark Trails Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bag\">Bag</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Belongings%20of%20a%20Deceased\">Belongings of a Deceased</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Belongings%20of%20a%20Deceased%20%28The%20Ravager%29\">Belongings of a Deceased